  "Liquid Life energy recovered by an Extractor. A trophy for use outside the field.": "提取器产出的液态生灵能量，可供局外使用的战利品。",
  "After a tide, seed the four adjoining plots as grass, add 1 Life concentration to each, and stabilize them.": "潮汐后，在共边四格播种，使其变为草地并获得稳固，各增加 1 点生灵浓度。",
  "After a tide, gain 1 Life point per 8 total Life concentration on the four adjoining plots, rounded down.": "潮汐后，统计共边四格的生灵浓度总和，每满 8 点获得 1 生灵点，余数舍去。",
  "After a tide, draw 1 Life concentration from each positive plot in the surrounding eight. Every 8 drawn produces a liquid energy canister. Unused concentration carries over.": "潮汐后，从环绕八格中浓度为正的每格抽取 1 点生灵浓度。每累计 8 点产出 1 个液态能量罐，余量留至下次。",
  "Plant 1 Life. Leave the first 5-second window empty, then wait 10 seconds.": "投放 1 点生灵，前 5 秒不追加，再等待 10 秒成熟。",
  "Plant 1 Life and add 1 more within 5 seconds. Leave the next 10-second window empty, then wait 10 seconds.": "投放 1 点生灵，在 5 秒内追加第 2 点，之后的 10 秒不追加，再等待 10 秒成熟。",
  "Plant 1 Life, add 1 more within 5 seconds, then add a third within the next 10 seconds. Wait 10 seconds.": "投放 1 点生灵，在 5 秒内追加第 2 点，在接下来的 10 秒内追加第 3 点，再等待 10 秒成熟。",
