  "Plant-machines on borrowed land.\nPlan your plots, read the four elements, keep the larder full.": "规划地块，汇聚生灵与余烬。\n以静默融合自然，以永恒记录与重塑。",
  "Every plot inherits its land type's base values. The seed adds small differences, and bound effects (natural features, machine auras, weather) push the four elements around.\n\nThe four elements decide how a machine's stats change. Fire and Water together set the plot's temperature class.\n\nUse Land view to see the field you're planning on.": "地块由基础类型与变体组成。生灵、余烬是自然能量，静默、永恒是人工技术。潮汐补充或抽离自然能量，并触发成对翻转或同基础同等级转变。温度由热度与湿度独立决定。",
