  "Life": "生灵",
  "An old current runs under the soil.": "地下流淌着古老的能量。",
  "Threads of fungus knit the ground and feed living parts.": "菌丝连接土壤，滋养活体部件。",
  "Pale flowers that drink heat from the air.": "从空气中吸取热量的苍白花朵。",
  "Hot water pulses up from below.": "热水从地下周期喷出。",
  "A glowing vein of buried heat.": "埋藏着灼热能量的矿脉。",
  "Shimmering air. Things move fast here, but not all of it is real.": "闪烁的空气加快运转，也带来虚幻。",
  "Acrid smoke that corrodes joints.": "刺鼻烟雾腐蚀机械关节。",
  "Green light that hums in copper.": "在铜线中鸣响的绿色光芒。",
  "Heat radiating from an Ember Lily.": "余烬百合散发的热量。",
  "Cool spray from a Mist Fern.": "雾蕨喷出的清凉水雾。",
  "Wind spilling from Leafwing blades.": "叶翼涡轮带来的气流。",
  "Waste heat leaking from a Seedpod Kiln.": "种荚窑炉泄出的余热。",
  "Spores settling from a Spore Garden.": "孢子花园飘落的孢子。",
  "Soft rain over the grove.": "林间柔和的细雨。",
  "Little lights crowd the machines and egg them on.": "萤火虫围绕机械，催促运转。",
  "Grit in every gear.": "砂砾侵入每一个齿轮。",
  "The air itself burns.": "空气灼热。",
  "Grey snow that chokes intakes but feeds soil.": "灰烬堵塞进气口，也滋养土壤。",
  "The mountain coughs up fresh ore and fire.": "火山喷出新鲜矿石与烈火。",
  "White-out winds.": "遮天蔽日的暴风雪。",
  "A rare warm hour on the pass.": "山口难得的温暖时光。",
  "A gnarled taproot sheathed in a brass collar. It worms down into a deposit and hauls the goods up its veins.": "铜箍包覆的主根深入矿藏，将资源沿根脉运出。",
  "A giant pitcher plant on a copper stand. It drinks dew from the air and drips it through a little tap.": "铜架上的巨大瓶草收集露水，经水龙头滴出。",
  "Four great leaves on a bamboo stalk, spinning a dynamo made from an old tin can. Loves a strong wind.": "竹竿上的四片巨叶驱动发电机，适合强风。",
  "A baked clay seed pod with an iron door. It holds a fire that never quite goes out.": "带铁门的陶土种荚，内部火焰持续燃烧。",
  "A rusty bathtub full of puffball mushrooms, watered by a dripping pipe. Grows fuel pods and sticky resin.": "锈浴缸里生长的蘑菇消耗水，产出孢子荚或树脂。",
  "Trained vines pull a wooden loom back and forth, carving cogs, twisting copper into vine and polishing lenses.": "藤蔓驱动织机，雕刻齿轮、编织铜藤并打磨透镜。",
  "A huge dried gourd strapped with iron bands. Boils water on ground heat and whistles power down a reed pipe.": "铁箍固定的巨大葫芦利用地热烧水，输出能量。",
  "A glowing lily in a lantern cage. Warms every plot next to it.": "灯笼笼罩的发光百合，为周围地块供暖。",
  "A tall fern with a bellows heart. It sighs cool mist over the plots next to it.": "有风箱心脏的高大蕨类，为周围地块喷洒冷雾。",
  "A clockwork flower the size of a shed. It closes its petals around cogs, lenses and copper vine, and opens to show a Bloom Core.": "巨大的发条花朵将齿轮、透镜和铜藤压制成花核。",
  "Heat in the ground. Speeds work up, but wears parts faster.": "地热加快运转，同时加剧磨损。",
  "Moisture. Cools machines (less wear) but makes them draw more energy.": "湿气冷却机械、减少磨损，但增加能耗。",
  "Mineral density. Richer yields, slower and steadier work.": "矿物密度提高产量，运转更慢而稳定。",
  "Wind and draft. Ventilates machines, cutting energy use and adding a little speed.": "气流改善通风，降低能耗并略微提高速度。",
  "Work cycles per second, relative to base.": "相对基础值的工作速度。",
  "Output per cycle, relative to base.": "相对基础值的每周期产量。",
  "Energy drawn while working, relative to base.": "相对基础值的运转能耗。",
  "Wear gained per cycle. At 100 the machine jams.": "每周期磨损，达到100时卡住。",
  "Blistering ground. Fast, brutal on parts.": "地面灼热，速度快，磨损严重。",
  "Warm and quick.": "温暖，运转较快。",
  "Damp air. Good harvests, slow rust.": "空气潮湿，产量较高。",
  "Mild and dusty. Gentle on machines.": "温和干燥，对机械较友好。",
  "Stiff joints, long-lived parts.": "关节僵硬，部件更耐用。",
  "Everything slows. Liquids freeze.": "一切变慢，液体冻结。",
